<section class="about-mission">
    <div class="container">
        <p>The Channel started as a wild idea — what if AI could actually help people understand themselves? Not with generic advice or personality quizzes, but with the kind of deep, patient attention that most people never get from anyone. We built it, and then something surprised us: it worked. People started telling us things like "how does it know that about me?" and "I've never felt so seen by an app." That's when we knew we had something worth sharing.</p>
